Keep a pre-draw copy when a fragment texture reads a current colour target.

The requirement and snapshot timing were checked against off_rt_snapshot in
JonathanDC64's ps3recomp fork, commit 61909373a2cb59f8679d8b96382e2899d656e4d0,
as used by DemonsSoulsRecomp e5a7426a01e2ffebc2820965a384f59518a15b53.
This implements it through the shared backend's optional colour-copy operation.
The SDK and that reference implementation retain their MIT licensing.

